# Natural-language wording of each question in tender.chain (authored by the AI assistant).
q1 | Which vendor are we going with for the tender right now?
q2 | What is the current cap on the contract value, in ringgit?
q3 | What was the deadline for submitting the tender documents on 18 March 2026?
q4 | Who is in charge of the tender document submission at present?
q5 | What is the status of the tender document submission today?
q6 | On 25 March 2026, which vendor was selected for the tender?
q7 | What was the contract value cap on 10 March 2026?
q8 | As recorded by 10 March 2026, what was the contract value cap for 20 March 2026?
q9 | Who owned the tender submission on 10 March 2026?
q10 | How many times was the contract value cap changed after it was first set? Count only changes that stuck; ignore anything announced and then withdrawn or corrected before it took effect.
q11 | How many times was the tender submission deadline moved after it was first set? Count only changes that stuck; ignore anything announced and then withdrawn or corrected before it took effect.
q12 | What was the status of the tender document submission on 25 March 2026?
